#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_active_shopping_cart
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid "BNPL Support"
msgstr "Soporte BNPL"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_multisafepay.field_payment_provider__multisafepay_active_shopping_cart
msgid ""
"Activate this option to show the cart items on the MultiSafepay payment "
"page, which is required to support BNPL. Note: If disabled, the payment "
"methods that require a shopping cart and are commonly known as BNPL won't "
"work: Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna and Billink."
msgstr ""
"Active esta opción para mostrar los artículos del carrito en la página de "
"pago de MultiSafepay, lo cual es necesario para soportar BNPL. Nota: Si "
"está desactivado, los métodos de pago que requieren un carrito de compra y "
"son comúnmente conocidos como BNPL no funcionarán: Riverty - Afterpay, in3, "
"Klarna y Billink."

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid "BETA"
msgstr "BETA"

#. module: payment_multisafepay
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_multisafepay.payment_provider_form_multisafepay
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> If disabled, the payment methods that require a "
"shopping cart and are known as BNPL won't work: Riverty - Afterpay, in3, "
"Klarna and Billink."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Advertencia:</strong> Si está desactivado, los métodos de pago que "
"requieren un carrito de compra y son conocidos como BNPL no funcionarán: "
"Riverty - Afterpay, in3, Klarna y Billink."
